Hi<%= " #{@recipient.name.to_s.split.first}" if @recipient.name.present? %>,

<%= @sender %> would like your help with a few questions for <%= @family.name %>: <%= @survey.title %>.
<% if @survey.intro.present? %>
<%= @survey.intro %>
<% end %>
Answer here (it is your own link, no password needed):

<%= @url %>
<% if @survey.closes_on %>
Please answer by <%= @survey.closes_on.strftime("%A, %B %-d") %>.
<% end %>
You can change your answers later using the same link until the survey closes. Reply to this email to reach <%= @sender %>.

If you do not want to get surveys from <%= @family.name %>, use this link and no more will be sent: <%= @stop_url %>
